  "bodyHash": "3c271322199f737c",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我强烈推荐搭配使用 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@thememesmeller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheMemeSmeller</a> 制作的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a> <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-metal-gear-mine-gear-rising-revengence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a>：<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-metal-gear-mine-gear-rising-revengence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Metal Gear</a>。</span></p>\n<p><strong>数据包安装指南：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2>⚠️ 重要提示&nbsp;⚠️</h2>\n<h2>（下载前请阅读本节）</h2>\n<p><em>（本说明适用于 Minecraft <strong>1.20.1</strong> 版本）</em><br>最新版的 Epic Fight 与最新公开版的 WOM 不兼容。</p>\n<p>请使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod/files/6145747\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight 20.9.7</a> 搭配 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://modrinth.com/mod/weapons-of-miracles/version/20.1.8.5.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles 20.1.8.5.6</a> 使用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1. 前往数据包页面：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-metal-gear-mine-gear-rising-revengence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Metal Gear</a>。</p>\n<p>2. 下载该数据包及其依赖项（列于页面底部）。</p>\n<p><em>（请务必下载上述提到的正确版本）</em></p>\n<p>3. 整合后即可游玩。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>在《我的世界》中还原热门游戏《合金装备崛起：复仇》中的部分工具与护甲！</p>\n<p>使用指令 \"/mgrr help\" 查看用户配置指令。</p>\n<p>模组仍处于早期开发阶段，部分内容尚未完成，但未来将推出更多护甲、武器，甚至可能包含 Boss！目前包含以下内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可正常使用的村雨（附带主题曲，b1.3.2+ 版本采用新模型）</li>\n<li>可正常使用的嗜血（附带主题曲）</li>\n<li>可正常使用的高频刀（附带主题曲，b1.0.1+ 版本）</li>\n<li>可正常使用的 Dystopia（反乌托邦）（附带主题曲，b1.2+ 版本）</li>\n<li>可正常使用的 L'Etranger（异乡人）（附带主题曲，b1.2+ 版本）</li>\n<li>可正常使用的纳米机器（附带主题曲，b1.0.2+ 版本）</li>\n<li>支持 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a>（b1.1.2+ 版本）\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>除非出于个人兴趣发布非官方版本，否则 Fabric 端大概率不会提供支持。</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creraces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"捐赠\" width=\"186\" height=\"56\"></a> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持 Forge\" width=\"186\" height=\"56\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持 NeoForge\" width=\"186\" height=\"56\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg//jwAeWYyGug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"加入 Discord\" width=\"186\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>（为了获得更佳体验，强烈推荐搭配下方的 Epic Fight 数据包使用！）</em></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-metal-gear-mine-gear-rising-revengence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a>：</strong><em>（展示视频）</em></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>游戏实况：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@thememesmeller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheMemeSmeller</a> 使用其自制的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-metal-gear-mine-gear-rising-revengence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a>（<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-metal-gear-mine-gear-rising-revengence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Metal Gear</a>）进行游玩：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NzKX0uFEkCc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hAOm6HJgxUY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>视频合集：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>以下是 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@thememesmeller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheMemeSmeller</a> 展示的精彩战斗实况视频，使用了包括 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mgrr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MGRR</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a> 在内的数据包与模组。欢迎前往其 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@thememesmeller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">频道</a> 给予支持！</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F1peiCMtq4w?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qeowrxn-fNo?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lmwAqi1rbeU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8M1WWiTWyAI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/R-I_r9e64mk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wEp0EvPY4Og?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0-Dk1bOy8Ig?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/l07Cs2YzSYU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hAOm6HJgxUY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>已知问题：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>如果在安装了 Better Combat 的情况下关闭村雨，它会删除你副手栏中的物品。因为 Better Combat 在手持双手武器时会隐藏副手栏，导致模组误判副手为空。</em></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持版本：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>1.7.10：</strong>不适用：无</p>\n<p><strong>1.12.2：</strong>不适用：无</p>\n<p><strong>1.14.4：</strong>不适用：无</p>\n<p><strong>1.15.2：</strong>AWS（废弃版本支持）</p>\n<p><strong>1.16.5：</strong>AWS（废弃版本支持）</p>\n<p><strong>1.17.1：</strong>AWS（废弃版本支持）</p>\n<p><strong>1.18.2：</strong>AWS（废弃版本支持）</p>\n<p><strong>1.19.2：</strong>ADS（活跃开发支持）</p>\n<p><strong>1.19.4：</strong>ADS（活跃开发支持）</p>\n<p><strong>1.20.1：</strong>ADS（活跃开发支持）</p>\n<p><strong>1.20.4：</strong>ADS（活跃开发支持）</p>\n<p><strong>1.20.6：</strong>ADS（活跃开发支持）</p>\n<p><strong>1.21.1：</strong>ADS（活跃开发支持）</p>\n<p><em><br>注：此为当前计划，后续可能会根据实际情况调整！</em></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>鸣谢：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>开发者：</p>\n<p>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mc_jojo3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">mc_jojo3</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>模型制作：</p>\n<p>&nbsp; 刀具模型由优秀的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fkazharzevel%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kazharz</a> 制作，发布于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fhigh-frequency-blades%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">高频刀</a> 资源包（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planetminecraft</a>）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>音乐：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;《合金装备崛起：复仇》原声带由 Jamie Christopher 作曲。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>音效：</p>\n<p>&nbsp; 《合金装备崛起：复仇》由 Kojima Productions 与 PlatinumGames 联合开发。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Discord 服务器：（<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creraces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreRaces</a>）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/844129861861376042?label=Join the Discord!&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF\" alt=\"https://discord.gg/QagkwvSWtC\" width=\"181\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>制作： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mc_jojo3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">mc_jojo3</a></p>",
